{"product_id":"sidney-sheldons-after-the-darkness","title":"Sidney Sheldon's \"After the Darkness\"","description":"\u003cp\u003eAuthor Tillie Bagshawe brilliantly recaptured the late superstar author’s magic with Sidney Sheldon’s Mistress of the Game —and now she does it again with Sidney Sheldon’s After the Darkness. A classic tale of love and betrayal, and a struggle for survival in the new world order, this is an enthralling novel with ripped-from-the-headlines immediacy, perfect for the post-Bernie Madoff era in America. A tribute to one of America’s most popular and bestselling authors, Sidney Sheldon’s After the Darkness is a novel that the master himself would have been proud to call his own.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:109 x 175  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: T. Bagshawe \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780007304561 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43508764868761,"sku":"12RC9780007304561","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/fa1158f50890c4177be7a9aa7fc6a514.jpg?v=1697701215","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/sidney-sheldons-after-the-darkness","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}